WEBVTT

00:00:53.580 --> 00:00:54.680
Si?

00:00:56.120 --> 00:00:59.490
Hm? Okay...

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:04.120
Got it. Where is it?

00:01:09.930 --> 00:01:14.370
You're from the STN? Sorry to drag you out here so early in the morning.

00:01:16.110 --> 00:01:17.470
It's over here.

00:01:19.680 --> 00:01:22.840
Judging from the condition of the corpse, you'd have to say he burned to death.

00:01:23.310 --> 00:01:27.750
But for some reason, there are no signs of smoke inhalation.

00:01:28.350 --> 00:01:31.810
I heard that there were no signs of anything else burning inside the room.

00:01:32.260 --> 00:01:35.220
Yeah, now that you mention it, the coroner said it was as if...

00:01:35.220 --> 00:01:39.160
...he was burned from the inside using a microwave oven.

00:01:42.300 --> 00:01:43.130
I understand.

00:01:43.970 --> 00:01:46.940
For the time being, we'll have someone come pick this up.

00:01:51.610 --> 00:01:53.630
You guys didn't come here to pick it up?

00:02:08.480 --> 00:02:11.330
I feel like it'll disappear...

00:02:11.160 --> 00:02:17.060
...the instant I look away.

00:02:19.410 --> 00:02:22.200
I just kept counting...

00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:27.640
...all the many traces of loneliness...

00:02:27.600 --> 00:02:35.010
...that I'd vomited up.

00:02:35.070 --> 00:02:40.950
In this time that seems so dry,

00:02:40.890 --> 00:02:46.060
...my heart is thrashing around and drowning.

00:02:45.990 --> 00:02:51.920
It takes those lies that make my head spin...

00:02:51.830 --> 00:02:54.970
...and tears them to pieces.

00:02:54.800 --> 00:03:04.640
 And the place I lose my way in...

00:03:07.170 --> 00:03:12.470
...is a dim, hazy world.

00:03:42.990 --> 00:03:44.420
We have an ID on the victim.

00:03:44.990 --> 00:03:47.510
His name is Tatsuro Oikawa. Age, 34.

00:03:47.790 --> 00:03:50.730
His father is the president of a pretty big firm.

00:03:53.100 --> 00:03:56.960
And the stupid son played with fire and really got burned?

00:03:57.230 --> 00:04:00.170
That's about right. Anyway, about the Witch...

00:04:00.640 --> 00:04:01.760
You found something out?

00:04:01.940 --> 00:04:04.600
There were three Seeds that matched the database back at headquarters.

00:04:04.970 --> 00:04:09.910
But two of them live somewhere else entirely, so they can be written off.

00:04:11.080 --> 00:04:14.640
In other words, our target is automatically decided for us.

00:04:15.590 --> 00:04:17.750
I'm sending you the data now.

00:04:34.200 --> 00:04:37.430
But why would she do such a thing?

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:39.830
You're curious about that, too?

00:04:40.810 --> 00:04:43.440
She was perfectly normal up until now, right?

00:04:43.810 --> 00:04:46.780
As I recall, you were born here in Japan, right?

00:04:47.280 --> 00:04:50.740
I moved to Tuscany when I was really young, though.

00:04:51.250 --> 00:04:54.520
But even so, you can't deny the possibility that a blood relation to you...

00:04:54.520 --> 00:04:58.120
...may still remain somewhere in this country.

00:05:01.060 --> 00:05:03.930
Sakaki and Karasuma headed over to where the Witch is.

00:05:05.470 --> 00:05:06.770
We'll head right over, too.

00:05:16.710 --> 00:05:17.680
Let's go.

00:05:36.630 --> 00:05:37.570
Anything?

00:05:37.570 --> 00:05:39.560
Doesn't look like she's made a move yet.

00:05:45.470 --> 00:05:47.600
Is this the only way in or out?

00:05:47.810 --> 00:05:50.010
Unless there's some secret hideout, yeah.

00:05:52.620 --> 00:05:53.380
What?

00:05:53.850 --> 00:05:55.440
We're starting the operation.

00:05:56.090 --> 00:05:58.680
Have you contacted the investigator from the Factory?

00:05:59.090 --> 00:06:01.490
Okay. I'm ready whenever you are

00:06:02.730 --> 00:06:05.250
We're taking her straight to the Factory, huh?

00:06:05.590 --> 00:06:10.590
The computer at the Factory decided that Aki Yoshioka needed some questioning.

00:06:10.930 --> 00:06:12.960
So that's why we're in a hurry.

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:18.100
But if Aki Yoshioka really has awakened already, won't this be a little tricky?

00:06:18.440 --> 00:06:20.670
If that's the case, we'll simply use brute force.

00:06:41.460 --> 00:06:42.730
That's strange...

00:07:03.250 --> 00:07:04.120
Cut it.

00:07:50.000 --> 00:07:52.700
Michael, looks like she's one step ahead of us.

00:07:53.740 --> 00:07:56.200
Right, contact the Factory immediately.

00:07:56.540 --> 00:07:58.770
Call the Administrator, as well.

00:08:17.730 --> 00:08:20.490
Anyway, I'm sorry, but I'm gonna head on home now.

00:08:25.200 --> 00:08:26.930
Well, see you guys later.

00:08:27.670 --> 00:08:30.110
Hey, I'm about to go home for today, too.

00:08:30.110 --> 00:08:31.670
If you want, I could give you a lift.

00:08:31.670 --> 00:08:33.870
Sure, but I don't have a helmet.

00:08:35.810 --> 00:08:37.900
No problem. I have a spare.

00:08:44.950 --> 00:08:46.220
Cracked it!

00:08:46.720 --> 00:08:47.920
Find anything?

00:08:48.360 --> 00:08:50.660
Wait a minute, let me poke around.

00:08:52.800 --> 00:08:53.800
A message?

00:08:53.670 --> 00:08:57.960
I am the one who killed these three men:
Tatsuro Oikawa, Kiyoshi Matsunaga, and Seiichiro Aramune.

00:08:56.500 --> 00:08:58.630
Signed, Aki Yoshioka

00:08:57.960 --> 00:08:58.630
I am the one who killed these three men:
Tatsuro Oikawa, Kiyoshi Matsunaga, and Seiichiro Aramune.

00:08:59.140 --> 00:09:01.370
This is a confession to a crime!

00:09:01.770 --> 00:09:04.830
Wait a minute. It says she killed three men.

00:09:05.440 --> 00:09:09.430
We know that Oikawa was murdered, but what about the other two?

00:09:12.150 --> 00:09:14.210
Wait a minute, I'm checking into it right now.

00:09:45.410 --> 00:09:46.540
We were careless.

00:09:50.590 --> 00:09:53.990
We should have been more alert to the chance...

00:09:54.420 --> 00:09:59.120
...that a Witch whose powers just awoke would cause a series of incidents.

00:10:00.100 --> 00:10:02.460
But Aki Yoshioka is dead.

00:10:03.070 --> 00:10:06.160
Michael had said that the DNA patterns matched.

00:10:07.140 --> 00:10:09.200
Are you saying that a ghost did this?

00:10:10.010 --> 00:10:11.300
A ghost?

00:10:15.210 --> 00:10:16.380
What's wrong?

00:10:16.380 --> 00:10:18.870
Amon, that sand that was piled up in her room!

00:10:19.950 --> 00:10:21.110
Sand?

00:10:32.770 --> 00:10:34.730
Seiichiro Aramune

00:10:32.770 --> 00:10:34.730
Declaration of clean politics

00:10:50.580 --> 00:10:53.280
Sand is North, symbolizing the quarter of earth.

00:10:55.320 --> 00:10:57.080
South is the quarter of fire.

00:10:57.950 --> 00:11:01.290
West is water. East is air.

00:11:01.660 --> 00:11:03.780
And the circle is the universe.

00:11:05.790 --> 00:11:07.260
What's the big rush?

00:11:13.840 --> 00:11:15.430
Astral projection...

00:11:18.070 --> 00:11:19.840
A rite to leave your body.

00:11:19.840 --> 00:11:20.770
Leave the body?

00:11:22.310 --> 00:11:26.250
Someone tried to contact Aki Yoshioka's spirit.

00:11:26.720 --> 00:11:29.010
So this person killed Oikawa and the others?

00:11:29.650 --> 00:11:30.710
That's why you're here.

00:11:31.320 --> 00:11:34.150
Aki Yoshioka's spirit might still be here.

00:11:34.860 --> 00:11:36.690
Use scrying to check to see if it is.

00:11:55.410 --> 00:11:59.210
I turned up a few things when I checked the Oikawa and Matsunaga angle.

00:11:59.780 --> 00:12:05.120
The two of them used to work in a nonprofit organization with a guy named Aramune.

00:12:05.590 --> 00:12:06.720
Nonprofit?

00:12:06.720 --> 00:12:08.590
Yeah, a volunteer group.

00:12:09.330 --> 00:12:11.930
A rehabilitation center for victims of domestic violence.

00:12:11.930 --> 00:12:14.290
But that apparently was just a cover.

00:12:14.600 --> 00:12:17.120
They were raided by the police soon after they started and got shut down.

00:12:17.930 --> 00:12:19.700
But that's not the problem.

00:12:20.100 --> 00:12:23.800
Aki Yoshioka had also been placed in that facility for a while.

00:12:24.310 --> 00:12:25.360
Aki Yoshioka!

00:12:26.110 --> 00:12:30.650
Michael, I want the current address of that third guy who was supposedly involved,

00:12:30.650 --> 00:12:33.010
...and the list of the people who had been placed in the facility.

00:12:33.880 --> 00:12:35.450
I thought you'd ask that.

00:12:35.450 --> 00:12:39.250
But there doesn't seem to be anyone related to this case.

00:12:42.160 --> 00:12:43.350
Okay, it's on its way.

00:12:44.530 --> 00:12:46.320
By the way, how did things go on Miss Karasuma's end?

00:12:46.900 --> 00:12:50.420
All residual traces of Aki Yoshioka's spirit were gone.

00:12:50.970 --> 00:12:54.300
Does that mean someone took Aki Yoshioka's spirit away from there?

00:12:54.870 --> 00:13:00.140
I don't know. The more important issue is who performed that ceremony.

00:13:01.540 --> 00:13:02.530
What's wrong?

00:13:03.050 --> 00:13:04.910
I had forgotten until just now.

00:13:05.650 --> 00:13:08.950
When Miss Dojima was going through Aki Yoshioka's records the other day,

00:13:09.280 --> 00:13:11.050
...she said she found some strange records.

00:13:11.050 --> 00:13:12.040
Strange records?

00:13:12.550 --> 00:13:15.620
As if there were two Aki Yoshiokas.

00:13:15.620 --> 00:13:19.090
Michael, go over everyone who was ever in that facility one more time.

00:13:19.090 --> 00:13:20.060
All of them?

00:13:20.060 --> 00:13:24.500
Yes. Recheck everything, including people who are already dead.

00:13:25.070 --> 00:13:26.570
Even the dead people?

00:13:26.570 --> 00:13:30.770
That's right. And I want to know what went on inside that facility.

00:13:30.770 --> 00:13:31.740
Put a rush on it.

00:13:31.910 --> 00:13:32.870
Okay.

00:13:36.280 --> 00:13:39.300
In any case, the first thing to do is to check out this guy.

00:14:06.280 --> 00:14:07.710
May I ask who is calling?

00:14:07.710 --> 00:14:10.270
I talked to you on the phone earlier.

00:14:10.680 --> 00:14:14.080
If you're wanting an interview, I thought I'd already declined the offer.

00:14:14.650 --> 00:14:16.450
Yes, but I would like to speak with him...

00:14:16.450 --> 00:14:19.460
He is awfully busy right now with the upcoming election.

00:14:19.460 --> 00:14:21.790
I'm sorry, but if you really must speak with him,

00:14:22.290 --> 00:14:25.320
...please put in another request via the election campaign office.

00:14:50.220 --> 00:14:54.880
I know that you guys are selling our bodies.

00:14:55.490 --> 00:14:57.360
What are you talking about?

00:14:57.360 --> 00:14:59.050
You have the wrong idea.

00:14:59.600 --> 00:15:04.000
You're sick, so all we want to do is make you better.

00:15:06.300 --> 00:15:08.960
Hiroshi and Suzu were fine.

00:15:09.470 --> 00:15:13.600
But they've been acting funny ever since they were taken away to the overseas hospital.

00:15:16.650 --> 00:15:19.810
It's all you guys' fault! I won't let you get away with it!

00:15:21.680 --> 00:15:23.340
You won't?

00:15:24.190 --> 00:15:26.620
What can you do about it? You're just a kid!

00:15:42.870 --> 00:15:46.810
No, it's not her... Aki is already dead.

00:16:25.950 --> 00:16:28.970
It looks like Aramune's facility really was shady.

00:16:29.650 --> 00:16:30.850
You find something out?

00:16:31.120 --> 00:16:34.020
The details are unclear,

00:16:34.460 --> 00:16:36.930
...but many of the kids who were placed in the facility...

00:16:36.930 --> 00:16:40.730
...were sent to hospitals overseas, saying they needed surgery.

00:16:41.230 --> 00:16:43.630
Overseas? But why?

00:16:44.200 --> 00:16:47.600
Donors. There were rumors a while back...

00:16:48.370 --> 00:16:50.670
...that there are people who use overseas hospitals...

00:16:50.670 --> 00:16:53.400
...to run organ transplant businesses, something they couldn't do in this country.

00:16:54.080 --> 00:16:56.310
That's probably what Aramune and his cohorts were up to.

00:16:57.450 --> 00:16:59.000
That's horrible...

00:16:59.310 --> 00:17:01.650
And about the list of the people placed in the facility...

00:17:01.880 --> 00:17:06.010
When I also looked through those who had already died, an interesting name turned up.

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:08.260
Cut to the chase, Michael.

00:17:08.260 --> 00:17:09.220
Who?

00:17:09.220 --> 00:17:10.830
Saki Yoshioka.

00:17:10.830 --> 00:17:12.760
That sounds way too similar to be a stranger, don't you think?

00:17:13.100 --> 00:17:15.960
Michael, what's the current status of Aramune's facility?

00:17:16.600 --> 00:17:20.240
Well, there was a small fire the other day, and it was shut down.

00:17:20.240 --> 00:17:21.240
A fire!

00:17:21.240 --> 00:17:22.240
It can't be!

00:17:22.240 --> 00:17:23.800
Michael, give me its location!

00:17:24.170 --> 00:17:26.040
I already looked it up.

00:17:51.500 --> 00:17:53.210
Chairman's Office

00:17:57.670 --> 00:17:58.700
So, you came.

00:18:11.890 --> 00:18:14.410
Aki Yoshioka had a twin sister.

00:18:15.460 --> 00:18:19.790
The files say that she died of a sudden disease, but who knows...

00:18:26.800 --> 00:18:27.870
Aramune's?

00:18:27.870 --> 00:18:29.030
It probably is.

00:19:08.980 --> 00:19:09.880
Amon!

00:19:19.050 --> 00:19:20.680
So, you have it, too.

00:19:35.470 --> 00:19:37.440
The same powers as me...

00:19:39.810 --> 00:19:44.370
No! The only one who can use this power is my sister!

00:19:51.220 --> 00:19:52.580
Only my sister...

00:19:53.590 --> 00:19:57.750
Only my sister can use the same power as me!

00:19:59.960 --> 00:20:02.520
Just my sister... Nobody else...

00:20:38.970 --> 00:20:41.060
Identical twins...

00:20:42.870 --> 00:20:45.840
Maybe it's no surprise that two people with the same...

00:20:45.840 --> 00:20:49.400
...genetic structure would have the same Craft.

00:20:49.980 --> 00:20:55.010
When it's all said and done, she was trying to avenge her older sister's death, huh?

00:20:55.650 --> 00:21:00.050
She probably used astral projection to find out who killed her sister.

00:21:01.260 --> 00:21:03.450
But why did Oikawa and the others kill Aki?

00:21:05.290 --> 00:21:06.160
Fear.

00:21:07.860 --> 00:21:10.370
Aramune was trying to run for election.

00:21:10.370 --> 00:21:14.500
So he suddenly became afraid of Aki, who knew about his past.

00:21:14.770 --> 00:21:17.440
And so he tried to shut her up...

00:21:17.440 --> 00:21:21.400
Their one miscalculation was that her younger sister was still alive.

00:21:21.910 --> 00:21:26.850
She must've helped her little sister escape, thinking she'd end up as a donor, too.

00:21:27.850 --> 00:21:30.340
By using a secret Craft spell to fake her death...

00:21:31.390 --> 00:21:34.750
The two of them were just trying to survive.

00:21:36.490 --> 00:21:38.960
That's true. Anyone would.

00:21:40.660 --> 00:21:43.100
But if we hadn't hunted her,

00:21:43.600 --> 00:21:46.930
...the younger sister really might have become a mass murderer.

00:21:48.200 --> 00:21:49.570
I know that...

00:21:57.910 --> 00:22:02.250
Yes, sir. The Witch was clearly well-versed in many spells.

00:22:02.980 --> 00:22:06.580
So, did you find any connection to HER...?

00:22:07.060 --> 00:22:09.960
No, sir. None that I could see.

00:22:14.260 --> 00:22:15.790
Are emotions clouding your judgment?

00:22:16.600 --> 00:22:17.690
No, sir.

00:22:19.970 --> 00:22:23.060
I understand. I'll check it over one more time.

00:22:36.680 --> 00:22:44.670
Just how far back do I need to go?

00:22:44.490 --> 00:22:47.530
Tell me.

00:22:48.740 --> 00:22:59.520
It's all so vivid that it hurts.

00:23:00.380 --> 00:23:09.410
The truth is, nothing can be shared,

00:23:09.090 --> 00:23:13.900
...so I never looked back.

00:23:15.170 --> 00:23:19.270
...all those promises...

00:23:21.210 --> 00:23:25.670
...inside me eventually...

00:23:24.960 --> 00:23:31.470
...gave up on that light from some other time,

00:23:30.670 --> 00:23:40.250
...like the light of a morning you can't return to.
